{"seq":2,"slug":"online-performance-degrade","title":"线上效果劣化预警","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-model-mlops/model-monitoring/online-performance-degrade","wordCount":3408,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"线上效果劣化预警\">线上效果劣化预警</h1><p>上一篇给出的是「输入变了多少」的度量，这一篇处理的是「效果真正变差了没有」。这两件事之间的距离，是运维里最容易出错的一段。搜索的日级指标波动天然很大：周末与工作日的转化率可以差 20%，一次大促会重塑整个点击分布，节假日的品类偏好完全改变。在这种噪声下，一个降了 3% 的 CTR 到底是模型劣化还是今天的正常波动，靠肉眼看趋势图是回答不了的——而如果每次波动都告警，值班同学会在一周内学会忽略所有告警。</p>\n<p>因此这一篇的目标是建立一个<strong>对噪声鲁棒、能在数小时内发现真实劣化</strong>的检测器。它的三个构成是：一个对大盘波动免疫的对照设计、一组分层到可归因粒度的指标、以及一个把持续性而非单点作为判据的决策规则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>效果劣化的检测问题在形式上是一个**变点检测（change point detection）**问题：给定一条时间序列，判断在某个时刻是否发生了统计上显著的均值偏移。它的难点在于搜索指标的季节性极强，且这个季节性并不总是规则可预测的（大促、突发新闻、竞品动作都会造成非周期的结构变化）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>失效场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定阈值</td>\n<td>指标低于某绝对线即告警</td>\n<td>实现简单，可解释</td>\n<td>季节性使绝对线无法设定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同比/环比</td>\n<td>与上周同期或昨日比</td>\n<td>抵消周期性</td>\n<td>节假日与促销错位时误报</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预测残差</td>\n<td>用历史拟合一个基线，看当前偏离预测多少</td>\n<td>能捕捉复杂季节性</td>\n<td>需要足够历史，突变期模型本身失准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对照差分</td>\n<td>与一个不受模型影响的对照组比</td>\n<td>免疫大盘波动</td>\n<td>需要构造可信对照组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切片聚合</td>\n<td>只在受影响切片上判定</td>\n<td>信噪比高</td>\n<td>需要事先知道受影响范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中<strong>对照差分</strong>是最强的一条，因为它把大盘的公共波动整体消掉了。搜索场景下的对照组构造有两种方式：与同一时段的其他流量对比（比如未被模型覆盖的流量、或另一个市场的同构流量），或者与反事实基线对比（用旧模型在旁路上对同一批请求复算，这是影子流量的复用，见 <a href=\"../model-deploy/shadow-canary-model\">影子/金丝雀模型发布</a>）。</p>\n<p>下图给出一条从原始指标到劣化判定的处理链路。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始指标流&lt;br/&gt;按分钟聚合] --&gt; B[对照构造]&#10;  B --&gt; C[差分序列&lt;br/&gt;模型组 - 对照组]&#10;  C --&gt; D[季节性与噪声建模]&#10;  D --&gt; E[残差]&#10;  E --&gt; F[持续性判定&lt;br/&gt;连续N窗同向越界]&#10;  F --&gt; G{劣化等级}&#10;  G --&gt;|轻微| H[进日报, 观察]&#10;  G --&gt;|显著| I[告警 + 诊断指标下钻]&#10;  G --&gt;|严重| J[触发降级/回滚]&#10;  I --&gt; K[第三章第1篇: 漂移归因]\">graph TD\n  A[原始指标流&lt;br/&gt;按分钟聚合] --&gt; B[对照构造]\n  B --&gt; C[差分序列&lt;br/&gt;模型组 - 对照组]\n  C --&gt; D[季节性与噪声建模]\n  D --&gt; E[残差]\n  E --&gt; F[持续性判定&lt;br/&gt;连续N窗同向越界]\n  F --&gt; G{劣化等级}\n  G --&gt;|轻微| H[进日报, 观察]\n  G --&gt;|显著| I[告警 + 诊断指标下钻]\n  G --&gt;|严重| J[触发降级/回滚]\n  I --&gt; K[第三章第1篇: 漂移归因]</pre><h2 id=\"对照组的构造与它的陷阱\">对照组的构造与它的陷阱</h2><p>对照组的质量决定了检测的灵敏度上限。构造得不好，检测器要么对真实劣化迟钝，要么对无关波动过敏。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱一：对照组被同一改动污染。</strong> 最典型的是「用未受影响的流量做对照」——但如果模型是全局生效的，所有流量都受影响，没有干净对照组。这时可用的替代是<strong>时间对照</strong>（把当前与改动前的同构时段比）或者<strong>反事实对照</strong>（旁路复算）。时间对照在季节性变化剧烈的时段不可靠，反事实对照需要旁路基础。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱二：对照组与实验组的构成不同。</strong> 如果对照组是另一个市场的流量，那么两个市场的用户结构、供给结构、竞争环境都不同，指标水平不可直接比较。正确做法是比较<strong>差分的变化</strong>而不是比较绝对水平：先算「模型组与对照组各自的同比变化」，再看两者的同比变化是否有差异。这在数学上等价于双重差分（difference-in-differences）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>τ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treated</mtext><mtext>post</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>treated</mtext><mtext>pre</mtext></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>control</mtext><mtext>post</mtext></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>control</mtext><mtext>pre</mtext></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\tau} = \\left( \\bar{Y}_{\\text{treated}}^{\\text{post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{treated}}^{\\text{pre}} \\right) - \\left( \\bar{Y}_{\\text{control}}^{\\text{post}} - \\bar{Y}_{\\text{control}}^{\\text{pre}} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2615em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treated</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">treated</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2615em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9115em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7823em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">control</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>双重差分的关键假设是「若无干预，两组的趋势平行」。这个假设在搜索场景下经常被违反——比如对照组是某个小市场，它的日间波动幅度与主市场差别很大。因此在使用前必须验证历史窗口上两组趋势的平行性。</p>\n<p><strong>陷阱三：对照组的样本量不足。</strong> 差分序列的方差是两个序列方差的和（在独立假设下），因此差分估计比单序列估计的噪声更大。用小市场做对照意味着控制组的方差可能是实验组的数倍，最终检测器的灵敏度反而低于不用对照。因此选择对照组时，样本量应与实验组同量级。</p>\n<p>一个更稳健的替代思路是<strong>放弃外部对照，改用多指标交叉验证</strong>。搜索场景下，如果模型劣化，通常会同时在多个方向显现：点击率下降、翻页率上升、查询改写的比例上升、零结果时的退出率上升。如果只有一个指标动了而其余都不动，这更可能是那个指标的测量问题而不是模型问题。这种「多指标一致性」判据不需要外部对照，代价是它只能给出定性结论而非定量幅度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分层-把-大盘降了-变成-哪一块降了\">分层：把「大盘降了」变成「哪一块降了」</h2><p>全局指标是各切片的加权平均，它的变化会被稀释，也会被掩盖。一个只影响印尼市场长尾查询的劣化，在全局指标上可能只表现为 0.3% 的下降——完全在噪声范围内，但在那个切片上可能是 15% 的下降。因此分层是检测器灵敏度的重要手段。</p>\n<p>搜索场景下值得默认分层的维度有四类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>分层依据</th>\n<th>为什么重要</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>市场/区域</td>\n<td>用户所在国家</td>\n<td>模型在不同市场的表现差异大，单市场故障是常见形态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语言</td>\n<td>查询语言</td>\n<td>与市场不完全重合（同一市场多语言），且语言直接决定分析与召回行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询类型</td>\n<td>导航型 / 品类型 / 长尾 / 零结果</td>\n<td>不同类型的指标水平差异大，混合平均会掩盖变化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>设备与位置</td>\n<td>端类型、结果位置</td>\n<td>位置相关指标（首屏 CTR、首位 CTR）比全局 CTR 敏感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分层带来一个统计问题：<strong>多重比较</strong>。分 50 个切片各自做显著性检验，在 5% 显著性水平下期望有 2.5 个切片出现假阳性。如果不加控制，每次检测都会产出几个「显著劣化」的切片，团队会疲于追查这些噪声。标准处理是控制错误发现率（Benjamini-Hochberg 过程）或对每个切片的阈值做 Bonferroni 校正。实践中更简单有效的做法是<strong>要求切片同时满足统计显著与实际幅度门槛</strong>（比如幅度超过该切片历史波动的一个标准差），两个门槛同时满足能把假阳性压到可接受的水平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"持续性判定与它的参数\">持续性判定与它的参数</h2><p>单点越界不足以判定劣化——这是整篇最重要的工程结论。真正可用的判据要求条件<strong>持续满足若干窗口</strong>。</p>\n<p>一个可用的形式是把决策写成对滑动窗口的检验。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是差分序列在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 个窗口的残差（已经去除季节性与趋势），定义累积证据：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>触发</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_t = \\max\\left( 0, S_{t-1} + r_t - k \\right), \\qquad \\text{触发} \\iff S_t &gt; h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">触发</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这是 CUSUM（累积和）控制图的形式。它的两个参数都有直观含义：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是「容忍的偏移量」（小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 的偏移被视为噪声，累积量会自然衰减到零），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是「触发阈值」（决定需要多少累积证据才报警）。CUSUM 相比「连续 N 个点越界」的优势是它对小幅持续偏移敏感，同时又能抵抗单点毛刺——因为毛刺之后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 会因 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_t &lt; k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 而衰减。</p>\n<p>参数设定有两条实用规则。<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 应当设为该指标正常波动幅度的一半</strong>（用历史残差的标准差估计），这样正常的日间波动无法累积。<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 应当通过回放历史数据来标定</strong>：把过去一段时间已知的真实劣化事件（比如某次发布导致的下降）作为正样本，把平稳期作为负样本，调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 使得两者可分。这样标定出来的阈值有实证依据，而不是凭经验拍一个数。</p>\n<p>去抖还有一个组织层面的设计：<strong>告警的接收人应当与指标切片的归属一致</strong>。全局指标告警给值班，单市场告警给该市场的负责人，单查询类型告警给相关的算法团队。这样每条告警都能落到一个「会行动的人」手上，而不是所有告警都涌向同一个收件箱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从告警到行动-诊断下钻的顺序\">从告警到行动：诊断下钻的顺序</h2><p>检测器给出「劣化」结论之后，运维流程需要一个固定的下钻顺序，避免每次都在慌乱中即兴发挥。推荐的顺序是四步：</p>\n<p><strong>第一步，先排除上游与平台。</strong> 检查是不是大盘波动（对照组的同比变化是否同向）、是不是数据问题（该时段是否有采集故障或回填，见 <a href=\"../feature-platform-consistency/feature-freshness-monitor\">特征新鲜度监控</a>）、是不是流量结构变化（爬虫比例、来源渠道占比）。这一步能排除相当比例的假告警。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步，确认是否与发布相关。</strong> 查发布日志（见 <a href=\"../model-deploy/shadow-canary-model\">影子/金丝雀模型发布</a>）与特征定义变更记录，看时间点是否吻合。时间吻合是最强的因果线索，此时应当考虑直接回滚而不是继续排查。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步，看输入侧是否漂移。</strong> 计算该时段关键特征的 PSI，特别关注第一步识别出的受影响切片上使用的特征。这一步把「效果劣化」与「分布变化」连起来，是 <a href=\"model-drift-detect\">数据/概念漂移检测</a> 分级判据中「行动」档的触发点。</p>\n<p><strong>第四步，看系统侧是否有资源问题。</strong> 检查延迟与资源指标（见 <a href=\"model-resource-latency\">模型资源/延迟监控</a>），因为延迟上升会以体验下降的形式间接影响业务指标——用户等得久了会减少点击，这看起来像模型劣化，实际是性能问题。</p>\n<p>四步的顺序不可颠倒，因为它按「排查成本从低到高、假阳性率从高到低」排列。跳过第一步直接去查模型，是值班时最常见的效率损失。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>排除的假告警类型</th>\n<th>典型耗时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1 上游与平台</td>\n<td>大盘同比、采集健康、流量结构</td>\n<td>大盘波动、数据故障、流量污染</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2 发布相关性</td>\n<td>发布日志、特征变更记录</td>\n<td>无关时段的变化</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3 输入漂移</td>\n<td>关键特征 PSI、分布形态</td>\n<td>分布变化导致的非模型问题</td>\n<td>十分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4 系统资源</td>\n<td>延迟分位、GPU/CPU、错误率</td>\n<td>性能问题伪装成效果问题</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"组合判定-把三套信号编成一条链\">组合判定：把三套信号编成一条链</h2><p>这一篇的判定与另外两篇的观测最终要组合起来使用。一个务实的组合规则是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>延迟/错误率越界</strong>（<a href=\"model-resource-latency\">模型资源/延迟监控</a>）→ 立即按护栏指标处理，不需要等效果指标的证据，因为它的代价是确定的。</li>\n<li><strong>效果指标持续劣化</strong>（本篇）→ 按上节四步下钻；若第二步确认与发布相关，直接回滚。</li>\n<li><strong>输入漂移显著但效果未动</strong>（<a href=\"model-drift-detect\">数据/概念漂移检测</a>）→ 记录并观察，准备重训评估但不急于动作。</li>\n<li><strong>输入漂移显著且效果同步劣化</strong> → 这是最强的一组证据，触发重训或回滚决策。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这条链的价值在于它把三个独立观测合并成一个有优先级的动作序列，避免了「三个面板各告警一次、值班同学不知道该先看哪个」的状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>效果劣化的检测本质是变点检测问题；固定阈值与同比环比在搜索的强季节性下都不可靠。</li>\n<li>对照差分（尤其是双重差分）是消除大盘波动的最强手段，但必须验证「趋势平行」假设、避免对照组被同一改动污染、并保证对照组样本量与实验组同量级。</li>\n<li>多指标一致性是一个不需要外部对照的稳健替代：单一指标动而其余不动，通常说明问题在测量而非模型。</li>\n<li>分层（市场、语言、查询类型、设备与位置）是提升灵敏度的手段，但必须控制多重比较的假阳性，做法是同时施加统计显著与实际幅度两个门槛。</li>\n<li>持续性判定应当用 CUSUM 形式的累积证据，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 取正常波动的一半、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 用历史真实劣化事件回放标定。</li>\n<li>告警接收人应当与切片归属一致，让每条告警落到会行动的人手上。</li>\n<li>从告警到行动的四步下钻顺序（上游平台 → 发布相关性 → 输入漂移 → 系统资源）按排查成本递增排列，不可颠倒。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线上效果劣化预警","id":"线上效果劣化预警"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"对照组的构造与它的陷阱","id":"对照组的构造与它的陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"分层：把「大盘降了」变成「哪一块降了」","id":"分层-把-大盘降了-变成-哪一块降了"},{"level":2,"text":"持续性判定与它的参数","id":"持续性判定与它的参数"},{"level":2,"text":"从告警到行动：诊断下钻的顺序","id":"从告警到行动-诊断下钻的顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"组合判定：把三套信号编成一条链","id":"组合判定-把三套信号编成一条链"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据/概念漂移检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-model-mlops/model-monitoring/model-drift-detect"},"next":{"title":"模型资源/延迟监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/ranking-model-mlops/model-monitoring/model-resource-latency"}}